<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at</p>
<p>the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat 2-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>4-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Michael Stich (Germany) 7-6 (7-5) 6-7 (4-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
